cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenAnstruk-2D, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OpenAnstruk-2D"
abstract: >-
  An open-source program for the linear static, modal and response history
  analysis and the design of plane frames and trusses that runs in a web
  browser, with a Live mode in which the user pulls a node and the deformed
  shape, internal forces and reactions follow at display rate.
authors:
  - family-names: "Ulza"
    given-names: "Adrian"
    affiliation: "Universitas Syiah Kuala"
version: "2.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/adrianulza/OpenANSTRUK-2D"
url: "https://openanstruk.org/app"
keywords:
  - structural analysis
  - direct stiffness method
  - structural engineering education
  - web browser
  - Timoshenko beam
